turn (\n    <div id=\"host-info-card\" data-testid=\"host-info-card\" className=\"py-6\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-4\">Meet your host</h2>\n      <div className=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div className=\"shrink-0\">\n          {property.host_avatar ? (\n            <img\n              src={property.host_avatar}\n              alt={property.host_name || 'Host'}\n              className=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover\"\n            />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-semibold text-text-secondary\">\n              {property.host_name?.charAt(0) || 'H'}\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"flex-1\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-text text-lg\">{property.host_name}</h3>\n          {property.host_since && (\n            <>\n              <p className=\"text-text-secondary text-sm flex items-center gap-1 mt-1\">\n                <Shield size={14} />\n                {getYearsHosting(property.host_since)} {getYearsHosting(property.host_since) === 1 ? 'year' : 'years'} hosting\n              </p>\n              <p className=\"text-text-secondary text-xs mt-0.5\">\n                Member since {formatMemberSince(property.host_since)}\n              </p>\n            </>\n          )}\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-text-secondary text-sm mt-1\">\n            <Home size={14} />\n            <span>{listingCount} {listingCount === 1 ? 'listing' : 'listings'}</span>\n          </div>\n          {property.host_bio && (\n            <p className=\"text-text-secondary text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed\">{property.host_bio}</p>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n","numLines":63,"startLine":1,"totalLines":63}}}
[2026-03-16T03:13:09.816Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YKtzeC55AdT5DXb3QeiTJH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete picture of all the files. Let me audit each component for accessibility issues and fix them.\n\n## Accessibility Audit\n\n### PropertyDetail.tsx (main page)\n1. No `<main>` wrapper - uses bare `<div>`\n2. Loading spinner has no accessible text (aria-label or sr-only text)\n3. Share/Save buttons have visible text, that's fine\n4. No aria-live for loading/error states\n\n### ImageGallery.tsx\n1. Thumbnails use `<div>` with `onClick` instead of `<button>` - need to be buttons\n2. Main image div has `cursor-pointer` class but no click handler and no button role\n\n\n3. \"Show all photos\" button is fine\n\n### PropertyHeader.tsx\n1. Host info button lacks aria-label\n2. Review count button could use aria-label for clarity\n\n### PropertyInfo.tsx\n1. Icons need `aria-hidden` to prevent screen readers from reading SVG content\n2. Uses semantic structure with text, mostly fine\n3. Could wrap in `<section>` with heading\n\n### PropertyDescription.tsx\n1. \"Show more\"/\"Show less\" button needs `aria-expanded`\n\n### AmenitiesList.tsx\n1. Icons should have `aria-hidden=\"true\"`\n2. \"Show all\"/\"Show less\" button needs `aria-expanded`\n3. The amenity list should use semantic `<ul>` markup instead of a generic `<div>`\n\n### ReviewsSection.tsx\n1. Rating bar is purely visual with no accessible text alternative\n2. Star ratings in review cards lack text alternatives\n3. \"Show all\"/\"Show less\" button needs `aria-expanded`\n4. Guest avatar fallback div is missing alt text\n\n### BookingCard.tsx\n1. Calendar date buttons need aria-labels for accessibility\n2. Check-in/check-out div with onClick handler should be converted to a proper button element\n3. Guest dropdown needs `aria-expanded` and appropriate role like `listbox`\n4. Calendar navigation buttons need aria-labels\n5. Calendar navigation should implement focus management or use proper ARIA roles\n6. Input labels aren't properly associated with their inputs via `htmlFor` attribute\n7. Error and success messages need `role=\"alert\"` for screen reader announcements\n8. Success message should use `aria-live=\"polite\"` to announce updates\n\n### HostInfoCard.tsx\n1. Icons should be marked with `aria-hidden=\"true\"` since they're decorative\n2. Overall structure is solid\n\nNow I'll work through these fixes methodically.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16677,"cache_read_input_tokens":23817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16677,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"39b08d1b-a899-42d7-8ffa-0f5a92d0cf98","uuid":"f495b555-d22d-49ef-b91c-755562912eaf"}
